---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="江振瑜（CYJiang）的个人简介、工作方向与开源社区参与。"
>
  <article class="content profile-page">
    <header class="profile-intro">
      <img
        class="profile-image"
        src="/images/profile.jpg"
        alt="江振瑜"
        width="420"
        height="600"
      />
      <div>
        <p class="profile-label">About</p>
        <h1>江振瑜</h1>
        <p class="profile-handle">CYJiang · @googs1025</p>
        <p class="profile-summary">
          云原生开发与基础设施工程师，关注 Kubernetes 调度、GPU
          资源管理与 LLM 推理基础设施。
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="profile-section" aria-labelledby="about-work">
      <h2 id="about-work">工作</h2>
      <ul class="fact-list">
        <li>目前在马上消费金融从事云原生基础设施相关工作。</li>
        <li>此前曾在 ByteDance 担任云平台工程师。</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="profile-section" aria-labelledby="about-focus">
      <h2 id="about-focus">技术方向</h2>
      <ul class="fact-list">
        <li>Kubernetes 调度</li>
        <li>GPU 资源管理</li>
        <li>LLM 推理基础设施</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="profile-section" aria-labelledby="about-open-source">
      <h2 id="about-open-source">开源社区</h2>
      <ul class="role-list">
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes">Kubernetes</a>
          {" "}Member
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/vllm-project/aibrix">Aibrix</a>
          {" "}Maintainer
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/volcano-sh/volcano">Volcano</a>
          {" "}Member
        </li>
        <li>
          参与
          <a href="https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/scheduler-plugins"
            >scheduler-plugins</a
          >
          和
          <a href="https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/descheduler">descheduler</a>
          的工作、讨论与代码评审。
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="profile-section" aria-labelledby="about-contact">
      <h2 id="about-contact">联系</h2>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/googs1025">GitHub · googs1025</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:googs1025@gmail.com">googs1025@gmail.com</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
